\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sb100\sa100\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Our Father, who art in heaven,
\par hallowed be thy name.
\par Thy Kingdom come, 
\par Thy will be done, 
\par on earth as it is in heaven.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Give us this day our daily bread.
\par And forgive us our trespasses,
\par as we forgive those 
\par who trespass against us. 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par \'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par And lead us not into temptation, 
\par but deliver us from evil. 
\par For thine is the kingdom, 
\par the power and the glory. 
\par for ever and ever. Amen \f1 
\par \pard\f2 
\par }

